From: qwen38-4090 <noreply@localhost>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 08:18:23 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 09/49] Research hooks: drafter fake-quant and dumps, Q5
 drafter routes, LS8 group scales

- NINFER_DRAFT_FAKEQ=B: requantize the Q8 drafter projections in place onto a B-bit G64 grid
  (q8_fake_requantize_inplace), to measure drafter precision before writing kernels.
- NINFER_DRAFT_DUMP=DIR: append the BF16 inputs of each drafter projection (eager mode only) for
  drafter GPTQ calibration.
- Q5 G64 Ada small-T routes for the drafter MLP gate/up (paired SwiGLU) and the down / attention
  output projections (dynamic grouped conv add, T <= 16).
- NINFER_LS8=1: per-row FP32 super-scale plus one byte per group (scale = super * 2^(-j/32)) for the
  row-split Q4/Q5 small-T routes; the container format is unchanged.
